        "id": 1072905
      },
      "writtenOn": "2026-06-10T14:57:21Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I am not sure tbh, we are still using this implementation.\n\nmulti-site currently calls this `receiveAsync` method (see [here](https://github.com/GerritForge/multi-site/blob/master/src/main/java/com/gerritforge/gerrit/plugins/multisite/consumer/MultiSiteConsumerRunner.java#L48)).\n\npull-replication already calls the new interface when possible (see [here](https://github.com/GerritForge/pull-replication/blob/master/src/main/java/com/gerritforge/gerrit/plugins/replication/pull/event/EventsBrokerMessageConsumer.java#L77)).\n\nwebsession-broker doesn\u0027t (see [here](https://github.com/GerritForge/websession-broker/blob/master/src/main/java/com/gerritforge/gerrit/plugins/websession/broker/BrokerBasedWebSessionCache.java#L249)).\n\n\nLet\u0027s discuss and address it separately.",
